thub.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120614#issuecomment-4791162137","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120614","id":4791162137,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHZNVGQ","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-24T15:52:10Z","updated_at":"2026-06-24T15:54:16Z","body":"This comes up periodically .. we have several functions for things like inside polys, and they commonly depend on winding order, and geometry funcs are often subject to float error on borders / corners.\n\nSee e.g. #80035\nor #86755 an example of dealing with float error pre-emptively.\n\nIf you search the issues you may find some that have come up before.\n\nAs @AThousandShips says, for bound functions we can try to document the need to flip the result / add params for CW / CCW versions.\n\nFor internal funcs the assumption is that you know these are gotchas with computational geometry, although a comment can always help.\n\n_Incidentally, it's common in geometry programming to get around these problems using fixed point or integer coordinate systems. I've been doing exactly this this week._","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4791162137/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]